  "body": "A beautifully designed masonry home and income, privately tucked away in a peaceful, bush-backed setting. Offering four bedrooms plus a separate family room, together with a legal two-bedroom income unit – six bedrooms in total.\r\n\r\nThe home has a wonderful sense of space, comfort and warmth, with a fabulous contemporary kitchen, stylish bathrooms and excellent indoor-outdoor flow. Large living areas open onto an expansive deck overlooking the beautiful bush backdrop, with plenty of sunshine and privacy.\r\n\r\nThe master bedroom enjoys a lovely bush outlook and its own private terrace, an ideal spot for morning coffee while enjoying the peaceful surroundings.\r\n\r\nThe exterior combines masonry, concrete and weatherboard, with a double garage providing secure parking and storage.\r\n\r\nWithin easy walking distance of both Mairangi Bay Beach and Campbells Bay Beach, and zoned for Westlake Boys’ and Westlake Girls’ High Schools, Rangitoto College, Campbells Bay Primary and Murrays Bay Intermediate.\r\n\r\nA special property offering space, privacy, quality, income potential and an outstanding North Shore location.\r\n\r\nThe home also features solar-powered underfloor heating beneath the concrete floors in the living area, kitchen and hallway. The house is naturally very warm, so the heating has rarely been needed, but it remains a valuable and efficient feature that can be used whenever extra warmth is desired.\r\n\r\n***  If you’re looking for a designer modern six-bedroom home or a home and legal income, this is definitely the best-priced property on the market in the Bays. ***\r\n\r\nVIEWINGS BY APPOINTMENT",
